  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f194806b-c082-5209-af1a-303701606510" activityNameId="e959d271-cd4e-5683-9626-f5ebb35d17ba" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Kaolin, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Kaolin, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of kaolin. Quite a large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process.;
CAS number: 001332-58-7; 
UUID: 4eeb3397-420b-3adc-8f5b-5db72d1a65af
Raw materials and auxillaries used for production, energy consumption in production as well as emissions to air and water from production, estimation of infrastructure of the site (approximation based on limestone mine). No waste reported to external sites.
Location: Data used are from one single company in Europe. They are used here for an average dataset for RER (Europe).
Technology: Data based on the information from one European producer. Inventory bases on filled in questionnaire.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: worlwide 41.1 Mt in 1999
Sampling: Data based on filled in formulaire of one single company - expanded with data from literature as well as general data from mining activities. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4eeb3397-420b-3adc-8f5b-5db72d1a65af.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
